WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400 line:12%
Maya thought she had missed the last train.

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:12.760 line:12%
Then a stranger showed her exactly the same key.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.460 line:12%
It opened the box they had buried years ago.

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:33.080 line:12%
Inside was the little train they had made together.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:41.800 line:12%
He had not come back for the station.

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:51.620 line:12%
He had come back for her.
